  <running_head>TRACT. II. CAP. XXXVI.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <signature>R 2</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">dine procedens, ad ordinem fensuum ac</l>
    <l n="2">naturæ intendentis instituitur. <i>Arbitraria</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">prioritas in <i>coordinatis</i>, &amp; unius generis spe-</l>
    <l n="4">ciebus obtinet.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">9. <i>Prioritas rei</i> est vel <i>essentia</i>, vel <i>exi-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>stentia</i>. <i>Prioritas essentia</i>, latè videlicet</l>
    <l n="7">dictæ, est vel <i>Metaphysica</i>, vel <i>Physica</i>.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">10. Prioritas <i>Metaphysica</i> est inter ea,</l>
    <l n="9">quorum conceptus objectivi <i>realiter non</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">differunt: Quemadmodum Physica, inter</l>
    <l n="11">ea, <i>quæ realiter</i> distinguuntur.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">11. <i>Metaphysica</i> prioritas <i>duplex</i> est, vel</l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>secundum existendi consecutionem</i>, vel <i>se-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>cundum conceptuum originationem</i>; <i>Prior</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">est, cum conceptus formales ita se habent,</l>
    <l n="16">ut posito uno non necessariò ponatur alter,</l>
    <l n="17">qualis est <i>inter generalia</i> &amp; <i>specialia</i>,</l>
    <l n="18">v.gr. inter Animal &amp; hominem. <i>Posterior</i> est,</l>
    <l n="19">cum conceptus formales ex se oriuntur, aut</l>
    <l n="20">oriri, sibique ita succedere <i>concipiuntur</i>;</l>
    <l n="21">Qualis est inter Ens ejusque principia, &amp;</l>
    <l n="22">affectiones; inter essentiam Dei, ejusque</l>
    <l n="23">attributa.</l>
    <l n="24" para="true">12. Prioritas <i>Physica</i>, sive <i>naturæ strictè</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">dictæ, est vel <i>generantis</i> naturæ, vel <i>inten-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>dentis</i>. <i>Priori</i> ordine, simplicia compositis,</l>
    <l n="27">causæ effectis, elementa mistis &amp;c. priora</l>
    <l n="28">sunt: At <i>posteriori</i> omnia secus habent,</l>
    <l n="29">juxta supra adductum Axioma: Quod prius</l>
    <l n="30">in intentione, id posterius in executione</l>
    <l n="31">sive generatione.</l>
  </main_text>
</page>
